{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hant",
  "language_raw": "Trad_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/sdc02_0080.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/sdc02_0080.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_01",
      "hash64": "EE58D31F07F68497",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳捉到阿羅拉的樣子的\\n寶可夢了嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_02",
      "hash64": "EE58D41F07F6864A",
      "text": "懷著阿羅拉的心情\\n四處走走吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_03",
      "hash64": "EE58D51F07F687FD",
      "text": "……很可惜，那隻寶可夢\\n並不是阿羅拉的樣子。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_04",
      "hash64": "EE58CE1F07F67C18",
      "text": "哦哦！沒錯！\\n那隻[VAR 0x0101(0001)]是阿羅拉的樣子！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_05",
      "hash64": "EE58CF1F07F67DCB",
      "text": "牠是會用集中了精神力量的尾巴，\\n像滑行般地移動的寶可夢。\\r\\n牠還被稱為陸地衝浪手呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_06",
      "hash64": "EE58D01F07F67F7E",
      "text": "這寶可夢會擺動\\n頭上長出來的金屬材質的鬍鬚，\\r\\n藉此跟夥伴進行交流呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_07",
      "hash64": "EE58D11F07F68131",
      "text": "牠那閃著金光的鬍鬚是\\n靈敏度極高的感應器，\\r\\n就連數公里外的聲音也能感應到！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_08",
      "hash64": "EE58CA1F07F6754C",
      "text": "性情善變、任性、缺乏耐性！\\n這寶可夢很受那些比起被別人照顧，\\r\\n更喜歡去照顧別人的訓練家歡迎！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_09",
      "hash64": "EE58CB1F07F676FF",
      "text": "這寶可夢擁有優秀的體能。\\n圓圓的臉孔和光滑的毛髮，\\r\\n讓牠在阿羅拉地區大受歡迎！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_10",
      "hash64": "EE5C581F07F99C6D",
      "text": "為了解決垃圾問題\\n而被帶到阿羅拉的臭泥，\\r\\n不知不覺中就變成這個樣子了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_11",
      "hash64": "EE5C571F07F99ABA",
      "text": "牠那看起來像牙齒和爪子的東西\\n是毒素結晶，一旦碰到就會中毒。\\r\\n所以靠近這種寶可夢是很危險的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_12",
      "hash64": "EE5C561F07F99907",
      "text": "這寶可夢因為是悠悠地成長，\\n所以變得不再需要精神力量，\\r\\n龍之力也覺醒了呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_13",
      "hash64": "EE5C551F07F99754",
      "text": "這寶可夢會噴出零下５０度的冷氣，\\n有時人們會用牠過去的名字\\r\\n「凱歐凱歐」來稱呼牠呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_14",
      "hash64": "EE5C541F07F995A1",
      "text": "這寶可夢生活在被冰雪封閉的深山中，\\n能從體毛中生出冰粒。\\r\\n人們曾經敬仰牠為神的化身呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_15",
      "hash64": "EE5C531F07F993EE",
      "text": "這寶可夢住在冰天雪地的山岳地帶，\\n擁有鋼鐵般堅硬的冰晶背脊\\r\\n和柔軟的肚子呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_16",
      "hash64": "EE5C521F07F9923B",
      "text": "為了將雪撥開，\\n牠的爪子特別發達，長得粗壯而尖銳，\\r\\n是能在雪原上高速移動的寶可夢呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_17",
      "hash64": "EE5C511F07F99088",
      "text": "這寶可夢的身體是帶有磁力的石頭！\\n在磁力特別強的部分\\r\\n附著密密麻麻的鐵砂喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_18",
      "hash64": "EE5C501F07F98ED5",
      "text": "牠受到愛吃的石頭影響，\\n全身都帶著電，\\r\\n是性格非常好鬥的寶可夢呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_19",
      "hash64": "EE5C4F1F07F98D22",
      "text": "這寶可夢的個性頑固且難相處！\\n牠心情不好的時候會放電，\\r\\n並發出像雷鳴般的吼叫聲呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_01",
      "hash64": "CE97A87B27A6F75A",
      "text": "什麼！？[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳已經捉到了嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_select_01",
      "hash64": "49B42BEA169DA8EB",
      "text": "我拼命捉的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_select_02",
      "hash64": "49B42CEA169DAA9E",
      "text": "小事一樁！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_02",
      "hash64": "CE97A77B27A6F5A7",
      "text": "原來[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳不只擅長對戰，\\n連捕捉寶可夢也很拿手……[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_03",
      "hash64": "CE97A67B27A6F3F4",
      "text": "橘子學院的\\n水準之高可見一斑。[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_04",
      "hash64": "CE97A57B27A6F241",
      "text": "葡萄學院的\\n水準之高可見一斑。[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_20",
      "hash64": "EE5FBE1F07FC7F96",
      "text": "好的，\\n那麼大家請集合～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_21",
      "hash64": "EE5FBF1F07FC8149",
      "text": "時間到了，\\n這堂課就到此為止！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_22",
      "hash64": "EE5FBC1F07FC7C30",
      "text": "還沒捉到的人就當作是功課，\\n要在下次上課前捉到喔！\\r\\n那麼，解散！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_mob_01",
      "hash64": "9A95444F99F3B847",
      "text": "呿～我得做功課啦～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_05",
      "hash64": "CE97A47B27A6F08E",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n在藍莓學園上課有什麼感想呢？[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_select_03",
      "hash64": "49B42DEA169DAC51",
      "text": "很好玩！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_select_04",
      "hash64": "49B42EEA169DAE04",
      "text": "很簡單！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_06",
      "hash64": "CE97A37B27A6EEDB",
      "text": "哇，太好了！\\n連我也跟著高興起來了。[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_07",
      "hash64": "CE97A27B27A6ED28",
      "text": "看來學院教的是\\n更高難度的課程呀……！[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_08",
      "hash64": "CE97A17B27A6EB75",
      "text": "啊！\\n我得要去社辦露個臉的！[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_09",
      "hash64": "CE97A07B27A6E9C2",
      "text": "學園的介紹就要到此結束了，\\n但最後這件事請[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳一定要聽！[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_10",
      "hash64": "CE94237B27A3DF84",
      "text": "在這個學園，\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]藍莓康樂活動[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]相當盛行，\\r\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳也可以簡稱它為[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]藍樂活[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
